                            {
                                "example_id": "feda3c7f-a49d-43dd-977c-6c5c871e974e",
                                "sense_id": "28d3bf8c-b88b-3c18-bc14-ed1ef824da6b",
                                "text": "But without importing into the case any extravagant conclusions, no doubt need be entertained that the overjudge at Strassburg wielded an immense influence; although, looking at the whole spirit of the Ordinances before us, it is hardly conceivable that his judicial decisions were promulgated on his own sole and undivided authority."
